            "slug": "training",
            "title": "修練内容",
            "content": "<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">修練日時</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"doin-training-times\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group doin-training-times\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"doin-training-day\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group doin-training-day\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>火曜日　志木市民体育館 ２階 柔道場</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>少年部　PM 6:30～7:45 （OPEN：PM 6:00）</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>一　般　PM 7:45～9:30</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"doin-training-day\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group doin-training-day\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>木曜日　志木市民体育館 １階 剣道場</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>少年部　PM 6:30～7:45 （OPEN：PM 6:00）</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"doin-training-day\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group doin-training-day\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>土曜日　富士見市民総合体育館 １階 剣道場</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>少年部　PM 6:00～7:30 （OPEN：PM 5:30）</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>一　般　PM 7:30～9:00</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"doin-training-times__note\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"right\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right doin-training-times__note\">※ 志木スポ少と一緒に修練を行っています</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">修練風景</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:shortcode -->\n[imagely id=\"1\"]\n<!-- /wp:shortcode -->",
